{"results":[{"url":"https://www.facebook.com/TomsRiver.org/posts/joe-bidens-campaign-is-living-on-more-than-a-prayer-to-help-him-win-the-white-ho/3276064329171534/","final_url":"https://www.facebook.com/TomsRiver.org/posts/joe-bidens-campaign-is-living-on-more-than-a-prayer-to-help-him-win-the-white-ho/3276064329171534/","title":"TomsRiver.org","description":"Joe Biden's campaign is living on more than a prayer to help him win the White House, announcing that the Democratic presidential nominee is getting a musical boost from Jon Bon Jovi.\n\nThe \"Livin' on...","language":"en","text":"Joe Biden's campaign is living on more than a prayer to help him win the White House, announcing that the Democratic presidential nominee is getting a musical boost from Jon Bon Jovi.\n\nThe \"Livin' on a Prayer\" singer will join Biden in swing state Pennsylvania on Saturday for a drive-in event in Luzerne County, the former vice president's campaign announced Friday.\n\nAll reactions:\n\n33 comments\n\n5 shares\n\nLike\n\nComment\n\nMost relevant\n\n\n\nElaine Swindell\n\nShould we wonder how many fans will come to see Bon Jovi. Gee, even some Trump fans could come to see him. LOL Anything to try to increase Biden's turn outs.\n\n7\n\nGina Scott\n\nDone with you! Your voiced sucked the last time you sang! Bye!\n\n4\n\nChristine Perrin Weightman\n\nEveryone of you that has posted is a hypocrite! First of all, you all voted for a TV reality star because you liked how he \"told it like it is\"...yet EVERY SINGLE TIME the man- child opens his mouth it's a proven LIE! Both Bon Jovi and Bruce put on incredible concerts. I would bet my life that you'd be first in line to see them. Lol. But yes...go on and say they suck. They will always be NJ icons. Trump is just a NJ stain that will soon be scrubbed clean and forgotten. #BidenHarris2020\n\n2\n\nView all 2 replies\n\nDawn Borg Smith\n\nTrump fans should hise trump gear in their trunks go the rally then break it all out. Fly those flags high! Free Bon Jovi concert. Bet that won't make MSM\n\n3\n\nGeorge Moretti\n\nSo sick of these musicians telling us who to vote for.\n\n1\n\nCamille Perrin\n\nSo, if all you repuglicans don’t want to be hypocritical and you all hate celebrities so much, you can spend the rest of your mean and bitter lives listening to kid rock and watching reruns of Charles In Charge ... while the rest of us get Bruce and Bon Jovi and The Godfather.\n\nHmmmmm ... I think I’m ok with that!!!! #BidenHarris2020\n\n1\n\nMichele Toni\n\nDidn't him and Springsteen try this for Hillary?\n\n3\n\nLucille Corcoran Manzella\n\nMaybe he’ll leave the US with Loose Bedsprings aka Bruce Springsteen when Trump wins!\n\n1\n\nNoreen Caitrin\n\nWho cares, Katie Perry did nothing for Hillary, oh and Beyoncé and Jay Z failed at it too so good luck with that\n\nTheresa L Cowdrick\n\nOh you can have Bruce his ego is so big don’t don’t want him , I don’t listen to Bon Jovi anyway and the God Father I been seen that so no loss there either .....and I do like kid rock and Charles in charge that’s a good show also plus I have a lot over other things to do then watch TV soooo yeah I’m good","author":null,"published_date":null,"latency_ms":2411.167567999655,"format":"markdown"}],"errors":[]}